==============================================================================
PASS B1 bound charge rho_b = -div P and bound current J_b = dP/dt + curl M obey continuity  —  max residual 1.1e-12
PASS B2 div(curl M) = 0: the magnetization current never piles up charge  —  max 0.0e+00
